","text":"Brazil ex-President Jair Bolsonaro taken to hospital over abdominal pain, DW reports.","cites":["news:dw:e735cc923d74"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:08Z","text":"On November 24 the Supreme Federal Court unanimously voted to keep Bolsonaro in police custody.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386713962:259"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:16Z","text":"Jair Messias Bolsonaro (born 21 March 1955) is a Brazilian politician and former military officer who served as the 38th president of Brazil from 2019 to 2023.","cites":["wiki:rev:1386713962:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:24Z","text":"Jair Bolsonaro was born on 21 March 1955 in Glicério.","cites":["wd:Q10304982:P569","wd:Q10304982:P19"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:32Z","text":"Educated at Academia Militar das Agulhas Negras.","cites":["wd:Q10304982:P69:Q2865871"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:38Z","text":"Worked in Brasília and Rio de Janeiro.","cites":["wd:Q10304982:P937:Q2844","wd:Q10304982:P937:Q8678"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:44Z","text":"6 awards on record, among them Ig Nobel Prize (2020) and Person of the Year in Organized Crime and Corruption (Ironic denominación, not a real award) (2020).","cites":["wd:Q10304982:P166:Q184253","wd:Q10304982:P166:Q104595803"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:00:54Z","text":"Black Friday deals for liquid Brazilian butt lifts criticised over safety fears, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:1bf52f5b8f35"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:01Z","text":"20 November: Here's a constructive approach to beating the disease, based on Brazil's experience, DW reported.","cites":["news:dw:11abc405874e"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:08Z","text":"20 November: The Munduruku’s fight for survival in the Brazilian Amazon, Al Jazeera reported.","cites":["news:aljazeera:6772eb991abc"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:15Z","text":"19 November: Salvador’s Bukele publishes video of attack on gang leader’s house, France 24 reported.","cites":["news:france24:14ac3f8f83f3"]},{"t":"2026-11-21T00:01:31Z","text":"DW headlined it: “Brazil ex-President Jair Bolson